Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep is cruel when pain is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When gripped by fear, let darkness rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.98,0:00:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In dreams of light, a gilded fraud, we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,drift in awe without our sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We wake in dread.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We ache inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We stare ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we recall the lawless fact: it will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,not slack, it will not pause — until we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:37.70,Title,,0,0,0,,sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It starts again the moment when we take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:42.78,Title,,0,0,0,,the leap.
